The CS2 update of 2026-10-22 (1.41.9.2, 14192) added a virtual to
CEngineServer right after MakeSpawnGroupActive: the IVEngineServer2 vtable in
libengine2.so grew from 122 to 123 entries, with the new entry at index 65
(this, SpawnGroupHandle_t, int). Every later method moved down one slot.
MultiAddonManager's GetServerGlobals and IsClientFullyAuthenticated calls
landed on the wrong function and the server crashed on startup.

scripts/build-steamrt3.sh applies patches/sdk/*.patch to a copy of the pinned
hl2sdk-cs2 in the output directory. Drop it once the pinned SDK commit declares
the same virtual.

diff --git a/public/eiface.h b/public/eiface.h
index 5d7ad93..8be26ad 100644
--- a/public/eiface.h
+++ b/public/eiface.h
@@ -263,6 +263,8 @@ public:
 	virtual bool	IsSpawnGroupLoaded( SpawnGroupHandle_t spawnGroup ) const = 0;
 	virtual bool	IsSpawnGroupLoading( SpawnGroupHandle_t spawnGroup ) const = 0;
 	virtual void	MakeSpawnGroupActive( SpawnGroupHandle_t spawnGroup ) = 0;
+	// CS2 2026-10-22 update inserted a spawn group virtual here; every later index moved by one.
+	virtual void	unk_spawngroup_20261022( SpawnGroupHandle_t spawnGroup, int ) = 0;
 	virtual void	SynchronouslySpawnGroup( SpawnGroupHandle_t spawnGroup ) = 0;
 	virtual void	SynchronizeAndBlockUntilLoaded( SpawnGroupHandle_t spawnGroup ) = 0;
 
